1105:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_can.c **** /**
1106:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_can.c ****   * @brief  Request the sleep mode (low power) entry.
1107:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_can.c ****   *         When returning from this function, Sleep mode will be entered
